{"id":"20b828a641244a9a","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-divisibility.md","title":"Divisibility Relation","display":"df-divisibility — Divisibility Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-divisibility","aliases":["90-df-divisibility"],"display":"df-divisibility — Divisibility Relation","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-divisibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-divisibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-divisibility — Divisibility Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (自然数集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mid\\;\\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^2\">\\(\\mid\\;\\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^2\\)</span> (整除关系, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisibility} \\vdash \\forall a,b \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\bigl(a \\mid b \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists q \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;(b=a\\times q)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisibility} \\vdash \\forall a,b \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\bigl(a \\mid b \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists q \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;(b=a\\times q)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\mid b\">\\(a \\mid b\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 整除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>（存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b = a \\times q\">\\(b = a \\times q\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>整除关系是原始递归的</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0771a0b97a16ee5a\" href=\"?note=0771a0b97a16ee5a\" title=\"90-df-prime-number\">90-df-prime-number</a> — 素数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a> — 序列编码</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb{N}$ (自然数集, see [[90-df-omega]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-prime-number","status":"resolved","id":"0771a0b97a16ee5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-prime-number]] — 素数","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]] — 序列编码","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\m